every summer)","uz":"Ular har yili yozda dam olishadi."}],"hwMcqs":[{"q":"My brother ______ to school every morning.","expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (he/she/it) uchun fe'lga -es qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi.","opts":["go","goes","going","gone"],"ans":"goes"},{"expl":"Ko'plik shakli (they) uchun fe'l o'zgarishsiz qoladi.","q":"They ______ English at the university.","opts":["study","studies","studying","studied"],"ans":"study"},{"expl":"You olmoshi bilan so'roq gaplarda 'do' yordamchi fe'li ishlatiladi.","q":"______ you like apples?","ans":"Do","opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"]},{"ans":"does","opts":["do","does","is","are"],"q":"She ______ not play football.","expl":"Inkor gaplarda uchinchi shaxs birlik uchun 'does not' ishlatiladi."},{"expl":"Birlikdagi shaxs uchun 'to be' fe'lining 'is' shakli qo'llaniladi.","q":"My father ______ a doctor.","opts":["be","am","is","are"],"ans":"is"},{"opts":["eat","eats","eating","eaten"],"ans":"eat","q":"We ______ breakfast at 8 o'clock.","expl":"We (biz) ko'plikda bo'lgani uchun fe'lga qo'shimcha qo'shilmaydi."},{"opts":["Do","Does","Is","Are"],"ans":"Does","expl":"Uchinchi shaxs birlik (she) uchun so'roq gap 'does' bilan boshlanadi.","q":"______ she live in Tashkent?"},{"q":"I ______ my homework every evening.","expl":"I (men) olmoshi uchun fe'l o'zgarishsiz qoladi.","opts":["do","does","doing","done"],"ans":"do"},{"ans":"rises","opts":["rise","rises","rising","risen"],"expl":"Tabiat hodisalari va doimiy faktlar uchun uchinchi shaxs birlikda -s qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi.","q":"The sun ______ in the east."},{"q":"They ______ not watch TV at night.","expl":"They (ular) ko'plik olmoshi bo'lgani uchun inkor gapda 'do not' ishlatiladi.","opts":["do","does","is","are"],"ans":"do"}],"reorderItems":[{"correct":"He reads books every day.","words":["every","day","he","reads","books"]},{"words":["do","you","like","coffee"],"correct":"Do you like coffee?"},{"words":["not","she","does","eat","meat"],"correct":"She does not eat meat."}],"slides":[{"body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155;'><h3 style='color: #38bdf8;'>Doimiy takrorlanadigan ish-harakatlar</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Present Simple — bu bizning kundalik odatlarimiz, umumiy haqiqatlar va doimiy holatlarni ifodalash uchun ishlatiladigan zamon.</p><div style='background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2); padding: 10px; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;'><b>Misol:</b> I drink coffee every morning. (Men har kuni ertalab qahva ichaman.)</div></div>","title":"Present Simple nima?","tag":"Slide 1: Kirish"},{"title":"Tasdiq shakli (Affirmative)","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #6ee7b7;'>Formula: Subject + Verb (+s/es)</h3><ul style='color: #f1f5f9;'><li>I / You / We / They + <b>work</b></li><li>He / She / It + <b>works</b></li></ul><p style='color: #94a3b8;'>Eslatma: Uchinchi shaxs birlikda (He, She, It) fe'lga <b>-s</b> yoki <b>-es</b> qo'shiladi.</p></div>","tag":"Slide 2: Formula"},{"body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #fb7185;'>Yordamchi fe'llar: do not / does not</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Inkor yasash uchun <b>do not (don't)</b> yoki <b>does not (doesn't)</b> ishlatamiz.</p><div style='margin-top: 10px; color: #f8fafc;'><b>I don't like apples.</b><br><b>She doesn't like apples.</b></div></div>","title":"Inkor shakli (Negative)","tag":"Slide 3: Inkor"},{"title":"So'roq shakli (Interrogative)","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #fbbf24;'>Do / Does gap boshiga chiqadi</h3><p style='color: #e2e8f0;'>Savol berish uchun gap boshiga <b>Do</b> yoki <b>Does</b> qo'yiladi.</p><div style='margin-top: 10px; color: #f8fafc;'><b>Do you speak English?</b><br><b>Does he play football?</b></div></div>","tag":"Slide 4: So'roq"},{"tag":"Slide 5: Kalit so'zlar","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px;'><h3 style='color: #a5b4fc;'>Present Simple'ni qanday aniqlaymiz?</h3><ul style='color: #e2e8f0;'><li>Always (har doim)</li><li>Usually (odatda)</li><li>Often (tez-tez)</li><li>Sometimes (ba'zida)</li><li>Every day (har kuni)</li></ul></div>","title":"Vaqt ko'rsatkichlari"},{"tag":"Slide 6: Xulosa","title":"Amaliyot vaqti!","body":"<div style='background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8); padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;'><h3 style='color: #ffffff;'>Endi navbat sizga!</h3><p style='color: #cbd5e1;'>O'z kundalik odatlaringiz haqida 5 ta gap tuzing. Masalan: 'I wake up at 7 o'clock'.</p><button style='background: #6366f1; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px;'>Mashqlarni boshlash</button></div>"}],"questionsPrompt":"Ustozingizga 'Present Simple' mavzusida tushunmagan yoki qiziqtirgan kamida 2 ta savolingizni yozing.","deadline":"Ertaga 18:00 gacha","blanks":[{"s":"She ______ (work) in a bank.","a":"works"},{"s":"They ______ (play) tennis every Sunday.","a":"play"},{"a":"Does","s":"______ (do) he speak English?"},{"a":"do not like","s":"I ______ (not/like) spicy food."},{"a":"arrives","s":"The train ______ (arrive) at 9 AM."},{"a":"visit","s":"We ______ (visit) our grandparents often."},{"a":"Do","s":"______ (do) you want some water?"},{"a":"does not go","s":"He ______ (not/go) to the gym."},{"a":"reads","s":"My sister ______ (read) many books."},{"s":"They ______ (live) in a big house.","a":"live"}],"topic":"Present Simple","enrolledStudents":[],"errors":["He play football every day -> ✅ He plays football every day (Uchinchi shaxs birlikda fe'lga -s qo'shiladi)","Do she like coffee? -> ✅ Does she like coffee? (She uchun 'do' emas, 'does' ishlatiladi)","I goes to school. -> ✅ I go to school. (I olmoshi bilan fe'lga -es qo'shilmaydi)","They not work here. -> ✅ They do not work here. (Inkor gapda 'do' yordamchi fe'li shart)","She do not speak Uzbek. -> ✅ She does not speak Uzbek. (Uchinchi shaxs birlikda 'does' ishlatiladi)","We likes pizza. -> ✅ We like pizza. (We ko'plik bo'lgani uchun -s qo'shimchasi kerak emas)","Does you live in Tashkent? -> ✅ Do you live in Tashkent? (You uchun 'do' yordamchi fe'li ishlatiladi)","He study English. -> ✅ He studies English. (y harfi bilan tugagan fe'llarda -ies qo'shimchasi qo'shiladi)","My brother eat apple. -> ✅ My brother eats an apple. (Birlikdagi shaxs uchun fe'lga -s qo'shiladi)","They is happy. -> ✅ They are happy. (Ko'plik uchun 'is' emas, 'are' ishlatiladi)"]},"deadline":"Ertaga 18:00 gacha","topic":"Present Simple","assigned_at":1791295857,"roomHash":"N4IgTg9hC2DSCmBPEAuEAVA8gZQLQDkAFATQA5cAlfARQDZcB1YgQQCYQAaEAOwENp4qEMV7cA5gEsABNgncAZlIAMtAPQBGJatZLWtTiAAu8XgGMAFvDD5+gtCPHTZC5Ws3bd+roYgAHCaZChGDwAM7w3IYyEtC+ADaCXAkAbvBxQszqBsZmlmAAquFgfAJCAAK8AB6QYNkmFlYAwua8hgCSACZCtADM6gCs--Dq8PZfKTnV28MAGzPQhbQOuGqQtACOEmbFbAUmSvCkHX10Eb5h5HZztvk5Yt9qkCws-1t9othgkFtu1u4Ukz-Ag3BRHt8ktu90efven1MPz+AKBIPBoyRUk0rGhrDhyJRrCxOLxBLEjKULNTNlKVwBJ5EMIEYS5UIeX2AVeloWh5HUbUrhOcUAFk7R5FAPTQqQ2l7KtuFLRV5HkeB4CkeBUjAI1oDZHNxBRKQwXQiIm0rfN-mkKwTQtE4pHbcxu1tCx+FEFF0Q9Q9JVUGTsgkQwEiCEJwkieN4konNoF4AB+bJeDEIRsF5Sj1CBWAJCre0QAAXw4UATSMtATP2SjWCBAAxNl6wtAwzguIQbjuX15TPC8IELa9QV4CEoVheEpERN8MWxXF8VzIl-1JQD2SpGlbnpRlmVJCUpRlY95UDYN+VoCjhhOYZtW8sBfN4IFsAWE4ACt4FMKIAGopAANSsASwQG0JVDCKTPR6SUFjiUL--nBc58V67J2eWM3xfl958V53MRd+CzWX5cPNOdJBORcB8Xw-wAzuNojXh5FMFC0IIhel6kEtKN4L4TSoRZZoVQmASUaE6aUV3r-f+UhAHANAbJGSCtkhK28IpZSaAB5D3tDraQYJ8DwGtMbeApt7KOSwarbAEtIBa3wV8XWYJ7bGDAJAUhdxyFO0CtcS+7dTzfG9lFP24JISB0SslZQaJPzpR-FlACscrDUlpEVJOLIyqpwEenGq2cTjyBfNqPU-09QN2tD6M4UsOYE3bLcZu81W5p2fiGMMEYowSmwLwZIPJUxWDtOPGc5g5zmMAlYns909QrwFkLNCpieZ4WbBLRA0tbjnwPCFbR19JDcDvn4R+OVnH8k1PIN+H8yqxIgMPU6oRfAmFLBjcQex7S6QhicCBESIANz+vEXgRpxw10+DMFpB80EoMVgZZyIBXLLFhB1OhEBmxm0cpbFy1t+gWWLIpbkbxMxuh4S7N2acvaXkBKI2K4iEoIhDjItK35MpR2yqyPKKjCqJyZBoyUWiPbwwziqXg-QTgwnftGVScZZAJngG8Uc7YAS9IQTmZsFpEADkzMMlui0nEIxcb3dxkp9rMDiA9XpZMwROl7P2Wa719q